/* COME TO LIGHT: a photo box enters under a dusk grade (an indigo overlay on the BOX, opacity only, never a filter on the image) and clears to the full photo when it, or an ancestor, is .is-on — and on hover / keyboard focus. .is-hold keeps it under the grade (e.g. the two tiers that are not hovered); .is-var takes the grade from --dk (1 = dusk … 0 = clear) for a scroll-driven lift. */
